# WordFlow AI Rule (qy_capacitor)

App identity: `poly_apps/qy_capacitor` is the **WordFlow AI** frontend (React/TSX + Vite + Capacitor). Its backend is the **AppQyV1** branch app inside `poly_apps/laravel_main`.

## 0. Frontend + Backend Co-Development (强制 / mandatory)

When developing a feature in `poly_apps/qy_capacitor`, you MUST simultaneously develop the corresponding backend in `poly_apps/laravel_main`:

- Backend app code: `poly_apps/laravel_main/app/Apps/AppQyV1/**`
- Backend routes: `poly_apps/laravel_main/routes/AppQyV1Router/**`
- Frontend↔backend contract: see `poly_apps/qy_capacitor/docs/api/API_PATH_MAPPING.md`.

A frontend change that adds/changes an API call without the matching `AppQyV1` route + controller (or vice versa) is incomplete. Run both via the orchestrator `poly_apps/qy_capacitor/scripts/start.ps1` (launches `start_qy.ps1` + `laravel_main/scripts/start.ps1`).

Detailed per-app conventions: `poly_apps/qy_capacitor/CLAUDE.md`. Backend conventions: `development-guides/LARAVEL_GUIDE.md`.

## Design System

When editing **UI** in `poly_apps/qy_capacitor` (React/TSX, CSS, HTML):

1. **Design Tokens.** All visual tokens in `index.css` (`:root` / `html.dark`) and `StyleCenter.ts`. **Mobile/adaptive:** `--touch-min` (44px), `--grid-unit` (8px), `--page-padding-h/v`, `--bar-gap`; use `env(safe-area-inset-*)` in layout. Glass/material/motion: `--glass-opacity`, `--glass-blur`, `--border-highlight`; `--material-thin-*`, `--material-thick-*`; `--ease-spring`, `--ease-liquid`, `--ease-smooth`; `--radius-card`, `--radius-button`; `--shadow-*`; bar/bento/fluid tokens.

2. **Base > Personalized (基类 > 个性化).** 主题、组件、样式均先应用设计系统基类，再扩展个性化类。Base: **`ds-material-thin`**, **`ds-material-thick`**, `ds-card`, `ds-glass`, `ds-glass-edge`, `ds-row`, `ds-empty`, `ds-btn`, **`ds-btn-pill`**, **`ds-btn-bento`**, **`ds-btn-fluid`**, `ds-section-label`, `ds-modal-backdrop`, `ds-modal-panel`, **`ds-bar-pill`**, **`ds-bar-tab`**, **`ds-page`** (自适应宽度), **`ds-page-contained`**, **`ds-stack`**, **`ds-stack-tight`**, **`ds-grid-breathing`**, **`ds-touch-target`**, `ds-aura-bg`, `ds-aura-overlay`. **全局顶栏：** 非 auth/非沉浸页由 **AppLayout** 统一提供 **TopBar**（搜索胶囊 + **ThemeToggle** + **LanguageDropdown** + 设置 + 头像）；Auth 页使用 **AuthLayout** 内 **TopBar variant="minimal"**（仅主题 + 语言）。组件中心化：**ThemeToggle**、**LanguageDropdown**、**TopBar**、**SearchOverlay**、**AppLayout** 为抽象组件，样式遵循 ds-* 基类。

3. **Glassmorphism.** Semi-transparent surfaces use `ds-glass` (backdrop-blur `--glass-blur` 30–50px, `--glass-opacity`, 1px `--border-highlight` edge lighting). Add `ds-glass-edge` for inner glow. Material presets: `ds-material-thin` (极薄玻璃), `ds-material-thick` (厚重磨砂). Layer depth: `ds-glass-sm` / `ds-glass-md` / `ds-glass-lg`.

4. **Background.** Page background uses `ds-aura-bg` + `ds-aura-overlay` (mesh/aura: cyan, purple, blue fluid). Keep page wrapper `bg-transparent` so aura shows; do not replace with solid fills unless required.

5. **Cards & Rows.** Cards: `ds-card`. List rows: `ds-row`. Empty: `ds-empty`. Modal: `ds-modal-backdrop` + `ds-modal-panel`. **Layout:** `ds-page` 自适应全宽+安全区；`ds-page-contained` 可选；`ds-stack`, `ds-stack-tight`, `ds-grid-breathing`；可点击 ≥ `ds-touch-target` / `--touch-min`。**顶栏：** 每页由 AppLayout 提供 TopBar（搜索+主题+语言+设置+头像）；Auth 页 AuthLayout 提供 TopBar minimal；抽象组件 ThemeToggle、LanguageDropdown、TopBar、SearchOverlay、AppLayout 中心化，基类 ds-*。

6. **Pill/CTA Button.** Primary CTA (e.g. login/register submit): use `Button variant="pill" showSparkles`. Styles from `ds-btn-pill`: full stadium (rounded-full), purple gradient (`--cta-gradient-from/to`), inner glow bottom (`--cta-inner-glow-bottom`), 0.5–1pt glass border (`--cta-border-stroke`), colored drop shadow (`--cta-shadow-colored`), inset top/bottom for 3D relief. Background behind CTA: backdrop blur 12–20px (`ds-glass`).

7. **Bento / Neo-Brutalism Button.** Modular high-contrast CTA: `Button variant="bento"`. Left accent block uses `--bento-lime` (fluorescent lime), right label area `--bento-deep` (deep gray), border `--bento-border`, shadow `--shadow-deep`. Use `IconsDotMatrix.ArrowRight` in accent. Compact: add class `ds-btn-bento-compact` for section links.

8. **Fluid / Vibrant Fluidity Button.** Gradient + motion feel: `Button variant="fluid" showPlay`. Tokens: `--fluid-from/mid/to` (cyan–purple–green), `--fluid-glow`; subtle background-position animation and hover shine. Use for "Play" / "Start" / "Create" CTAs.

9. **Components.** `components/UI.tsx` Card uses `ds-card`; Button variants: `primary`, `pill`, **`bento`**, **`fluid`**, `secondary`, `outline`, `danger`, `ghost`. Style governance: `--primary-blur`, `--shadow-deep`; icons use atomic grid (e.g. `IconsDotMatrix`). StyleCenter.ts references tokens; do not bypass for one-off inline styles.

10. **Bottom bar.** `ds-bar-pill` 自适应宽度（left/right 用 `--bar-gap` 与 safe-area）；`ds-bar-tab` 含 `min-width/min-height: var(--touch-min)`。Animation: `--ease-spring` / `--ease-liquid`.

**AI prompts:** Hyper-realistic Glassmorphism, Aurora mesh gradients, Liquid morphing, Spring-based physics. **Centralized:** global token + material presets + single motion curve. **Mobile:** adaptive layout (no fixed width), safe area, touch targets ≥44px, base > personalized for theme/components/styles.

## 11. v4.1 Iris Layer (additive — evolution of v4.0, do not replace v3.x)

Additive on the glass/aurora system; v3.x stays valid. v4.1 is an **evolution
of v4.0**: it keeps the **same v4.0 token NAMES** (stable API for 100+ pages —
no per-page accent edits) but **re-tunes the values** to the reference Iris
palette and **adds a gradient hero layer + a centered floating island**.

- **Canonical reference images (强制 parity gate).** The app's visual source
  of truth is `poly_apps/qy_capacitor/public/design-reference-light.webp`
  (light) and `…/design-reference-dark.webp` (dark). Before changing/creating
  ANY component or page with visible design, first open (`Read`) BOTH images
  and verify your output matches them (palette, gradient-vs-solid, radius,
  glass, spacing, island nav, pill menus, titles, tiles, dark/light). An
  unverified design change is a defect. Tag every redesigned file with the
  `/* [v4.1-Iris] … */` marker comment (spec §0). Rolling status:
  `docs/design/REDESIGN_PROGRESS.md`.
- **Iris palette.** Light = soft lavender/periwinkle bg (`body #ECEDFB`,
  `ds-aura-bg` lavender gradient). Dark = deep near-black indigo
  (`body #07070f`) with violet ambient glow.
- **Solid vs gradient (mandatory).** Solid `--klein-*` (re-tuned, light
  `#3B49E0` / dark `#6E84FF`) for **text / icons / active / borders / soft
  tints** — `Button variant="klein"`/`primary` (`ds-btn-klein`). Gradient
  `--klein-grad-*` / `--klein-gradient` (periwinkle→violet) for **hero
  surfaces only**: primary CTA (`Button variant="grad"` / `ds-btn-grad`),
  active pill, floating-island center, FAB (`ds-fab-grad`), bento corner-chip
  (`ds-bento-chip`). Never ad-hoc `bg-blue-600`/purple; never paint body text
  in the gradient; never a flat blue on a hero surface.
- **Centered floating island.** `ds-bar-pill` is a centered island
  (`left:50%; translateX(-50%); width:min(100vw - 2*--bar-gap, 430px)`,
  lifted, saturated blur); `ds-bar-cta` = 62px gradient orb with 4px
  bar-colored ring, `translateY(-18px)`; active side-tab icon wrap = gradient.
- **Pill nav.** Category/filter/segment rows = `<PillNav>` / `ds-pill-nav` +
  `ds-pill-chip` (bigger: 40px min-height, `.is-active` = gradient fill).
  Never `<select>`/table header. Tables/dense grids → `ds-row`/`ds-card`/
  `ds-grid-breathing`.
- **New classes / primitives.** `ds-section-title`, `ds-section-sub`,
  `ds-link-more`, `ds-icon-tile`, `ds-fab-grad`, `ds-btn-grad`, `ds-bento`,
  `ds-bento-chip`. Consume the `components/UI.tsx` primitives — `SectionTitle`,
  `IconTile`, `FabGrad`, `BentoTile`, `Button variant="grad"`, plus the frozen
  `Spinner`/`LoadingState`, `EmptyState`, `IconButton`, `BackButton`,
  `PageHeader`, `Badge` and `Icons.Bell`/`Icons.Filter`. Re-implementing any
  of these inline is a defect (spec §3.8).
- **Stacking discipline (强制).** No hand-rolled `absolute … z-50` dropdown
  inside a card/scroll area (gets trapped by backdrop-filter/transform/overflow
  stacking contexts → renders under the chrome). Anchored floating panels →
  `<Popover>`/`<Portal>` (UI.tsx, portals to body); full-screen modals →
  `<Sheet>`/`ds-z-modal`. Only the centralized z-scale tokens/utilities
  (`--z-base/-raised/-sticky/-chrome/-popover/-modal/-toast`,
  `.ds-z-*`): sticky 30 < chrome 40 < popover 60 < modal 80 < toast 95.
  Spec §3.9; refs: `ApiEndpointSwitcher.tsx`, `LanguageDropdown.tsx`.
- **Icons / no-emoji (强制).** Emoji are NEVER a UI icon/affordance (only in
  real user content). Use `components/UI.tsx` `Icons.*` for core glyphs, else
  **`lucide-react`** — the single approved icon library (~1,500 icons, in the
  `index.html` importmap + package.json). No other lib, no ad-hoc SVG when a
  lucide/`Icons.*` exists; size via `w-*/h-*`, color via `currentColor`/tokens.
  Content pages = centred phone column `max-w-md mx-auto`/`.ds-page` (never
  `max-w-2xl/4xl/5xl`). Spec §3.10; ref `pages/Profile/Profile.tsx`.
- **Dark/light parity is acceptance criteria** for every token/state.
- **Interaction design (交互设计).** Information architecture, navigation (5-tab
  island), app-shell/chrome rules, user flows, interaction states, overlay/
  stacking model and motion now live in the **same** design doc, **Part B
  (§7–§12)** — each topic documents the current UI (现在的UI) and the expected
  UI (预期的UI). Use it when changing navigation, flows, overlays, or states;
  `architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md` §8 keeps only the technical RouteCenter API.

Full v4.1 bullets live in **`poly_apps/qy_capacitor/CLAUDE.md` §5** (do not
